@startuml
title Reconciliation of Online Top-up with Payment Gateway

|Finance Staff|
start
:Log in to Finance module;
:Open "Online Top-up Reconciliation" screen;

|Wallet System|
:Authenticate Finance Staff;
:Display reconciliation options;

|Finance Staff|
:Select date range for reconciliation;
:Request "Top-up Online" transactions\nfor that period;

|Wallet System|
:Fetch TOPUP_ONLINE transactions\nwith status SUCCESS for period;
:Display or export list to Finance Staff;

|Finance Staff|
:Obtain payment gateway/bank report\nfor the same period (file or portal) (outside system);
:Upload report file or input summary\ninto reconciliation tool;

|Wallet System|
:Compare internal transactions with\ngateway/bank data (orderId, amount, date);
:Identify:
- Matched transactions,
- Internal only (missing on gateway),
- Gateway only (missing internally);
:Display reconciliation results;

|Finance Staff|
:Review mismatches;
if (Mismatches exist?) then (yes)
  :Investigate cause (timing, errors,\nmanual corrections, gateway issues);
  :Document resolution steps;
else (no)
  :Mark period as "Reconciled OK";
endif

|Wallet System|
:Store reconciliation status and report\nfor audit purposes;

|Finance Staff|
:Finish reconciliation process;
stop
@enduml
